<title>USA: US Trade Rep - views same on Japan insurance pact.</title>
<headline>US Trade Rep - views same on Japan insurance pact.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. and Japanese interpretations of an interim insurance pact are the same, Acting U.S. Trade Representative Charlene Barshefsky said Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;It's exactly what (Japan's Finance Minister Wataru) Kubo was saying, third sector entry is barred for the new subsidiaries,&quot; she said to reporters after speaking to the Women's Foreign Policy Group.</p>
<p>&quot;What the licences say is not before January 1, it doesn't give them authority on January 1,&quot; she said.</p>
</text>
